VERIFYING A DOWNLOAD

  Each release is published with the SHA-256 of its jar, and the build is reproducible:
  the same source produces a byte-identical jar. If the hash of the file you have does
  not match the one published with the release, it is not this plugin, whatever it says
  on the tin. Do not run it.

